ance extensible without weakening privacy or compatibility"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"Agents remain zero-configuration while history records the context needed to understand who acted and under what reasoning profile"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"The current accepted ADR requires an amendment before pm-itsjf0 can change the durable identity shape"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-m2u1"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-0zcwz6","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-27T04:36:34.996Z"},{"id":"pm-itsjf0","kind":"blocks","created_at":"2026-07-27T04:36:34.996Z"},{"id":"pm-qwuber","kind":"supersedes","created_at":"2026-07-27T04:36:34.996Z"},{"id":"pm-z8qd4k","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-27T04:36:34.996Z"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-27T04:36:34.996Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Duplicate check evidence: searched all-status tracker for reasoning effort provenance identity,session role topic identity,model capture harness signal,and the closed identity ADR lineage; pm-itsjf0 owns implementation and pm-qwuber is the accepted predecessor,with no existing amendment Decision."}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"2aa818be7b64db51ade3893707461b2657c28a57ea38dcd6e41ff3d8f5b0435e","message":"Create required identity provenance ADR amendment from live all-status duplicate check"}
